      "side": 1,
      "message": "this looks dangerous, if you get unlucky and you run just a little bit later then scheduled - then you can miss updating things.\n\n(btw. unlucky is probably the common case)\n\nyou might need to do:\n  \u003c slack CONNTRACK_TIMEOUT_UPDATE_INTERVAL_MS\ninstead\n\nwhere slack could be 1.5* for example, or even just 2*, or X+ for some slack value of X, or even X+1.5* or something.\n\nI\u0027m not sure what sort of real time guarantees java/scheduler offer us... but probably not very good.",
